sequenceDiagram
    participant O1 as Observer A<br/>SyslogObserver
    participant O2 as Observer B<br/>AlertObserver
    participant S as Subject<br/>InterfaceModel
    O1->>S: attach(syslog)
    O2->>S: attach(alerts)
    Note over S: state changes<br/>Gi1/0/2 up → down
    S->>O1: update(event)
    S->>O2: update(event)
    Note over S: same state again<br/>no change → no notify
    O2->>S: detach(alerts)
    Note over S: state changes<br/>Gi1/0/1 up → down
    S->>O1: update(event)
    Note over O2: detached: hears nothing
